window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A new romantasy novel written from the perspective of Grim, from #1 </b><b><i>New York Times</i></b><b>-bestselling author and #BookTok sensation Alex Aster</b></p> <p><b>True love knows no bounds.</b></p> <p>This novel—told from Grim’s perspective—gives listeners insight into his past: the motivations and events that cemented his fate as Isla’s eventual love interest. It includes key moments from the ruler’s love story with Isla, told in his own voice.</p> <p><i>Grim </i>is certain to thrill listeners and test allegiances, leaving new and longtime fans second-guessing who they’re rooting for in the breathtaking battle for Isla’s heart.</p>"; 
